    {
      "part": "markings",
      "looks_like": "faint to moderately dark brown-black tiger-like vertical and horizontal stripes and spots",
      "where": "across the forehead, cheeks, back, sides, torso, and most densely on the hind legs and lower front legs, with a paler belly and chest"
